## SQ-CAL-06c | arid locate on normal terrain
> locate biome #creativeengineering:seasons/arid
waitlog (Located|Could not find) 300
expect (desert|badlands|sands|canyon|oasis|spires|mesa)
## SQ-CDV-03c | dumpclimatecaves on a multi_noise overworld
> dumpclimatecaves
waitlog \[dumpclimatecaves\].*(wrote|done|failed|Dumped)|Dumped.*climate 600
reject ReferenceError
